WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.999
What if your next collectible held a stock portfolio?

2
00:00:03.433 --> 00:00:08.713
Choose a company. Or try a mystery pull, and discover the stock inside.

3
00:00:09.967 --> 00:00:16.087
Break the seal. Meet your character. Then flip it over to see what backs it.

4
00:00:16.533 --> 00:00:23.829
The N F T is an ownership claim. Here, it represents a tokenized Nvidia position in its own on-chain vault.

5
00:00:25.267 --> 00:00:30.427
A group Canopy holds several stock tokens. Each card owns a share.

6
00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:37.896
Assets set the net asset value. Collectors set the resale price. Above or below the backing.

7
00:00:38.333 --> 00:00:40.829
Your seed becomes your character.

8
00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:45.484
Build a collection worth knowing by name.

9
00:00:47.067 --> 00:00:53.163
Hold. Trade. Redeem. Stock redemption is still in development.

10
00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:58.280
Canopy. Stock ownership, for the collector generation.
